graph TD
    classDef sys fill:#1E293B,stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:2px,color:#F8FAFC
    classDef agent fill:#0369A1,stroke:#38BDF8,stroke-width:2px,color:#F0F9FF
    classDef valid fill:#854D0E,stroke:#FACC15,stroke-width:2px,color:#FEFCE8
    classDef execute fill:#166534,stroke:#4ADE80,stroke-width:2px,color:#F0FDF4

    U[User Request]:::sys --> C[Trusted Execution Context]:::sys
    C --> AS[Agent State]:::sys
    
    subgraph Agent Runtime [Agent Runtime / Framework]
        AS --> M[Model Decision Policy]:::agent
        M --> P[Tool/Action Proposal]:::agent
        P --> Schema[1. Schema Validation]:::valid
        Schema --> Sem[2. Semantic Validation]:::valid
        Sem --> Biz[3. Business Validation]:::valid
        Biz --> Auth[4. Authorization]:::valid
        Auth --> App[5. Human Approval]:::valid
        App --> Exec[6. Tool Execution]:::execute
        Exec --> Obs[7. Observation & Trace]:::sys
        Obs --> AS
    end
    
    AS -.-> Term[Terminal Condition Reached]:::sys
    Term --> Result[Structured Final Result]:::execute
